":"of foreign derivation;","def":"Tartak, a deity of the Avvites","kjv":"Tartak.","count":1},"H8663":{"lemma":"תְּשֻׁאָה","xlit":"tᵉshuʼâh","pron":"tesh-oo-aw'","from":"from H7722 (שׁוֹא);","def":"a crashing or loud clamor","kjv":"crying, noise, shouting, stir.","count":4},"H8664":{"lemma":"תִּשְׁבִּי","xlit":"Tishbîy","pron":"tish-bee'","from":"patrial from an unused name meaning recourse;","def":"a Tishbite or inhabitant of Tishbeh (in Gilead)","kjv":"Tishbite.","count":6},"H8665":{"lemma":"תַּשְׁבֵּץ","xlit":"tashbêts","pron":"tash-bates'","from":"from H7660 (שָׁבַץ);","def":"checkered stuff (as reticulated)","kjv":"broidered.","count":1},"H8666":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּבָה","xlit":"tᵉshûwbâh","pron":"tesh-oo-baw'","from":"or תְּשֻׁבָה; from H7725 (שׁוּב);","def":"a recurrence (of time or place); a reply (as returned)","kjv":"answer, be expired, return.","count":8},"H8667":{"lemma":"תְּשׂוּמֶת","xlit":"tᵉsûwmeth","pron":"tes-oo-meth'","from":"from H7760 (שׂוּם);","def":"a deposit, i.e. pledging","kjv":"[phrase] fellowship.","count":1},"H8668":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּעָה","xlit":"tᵉshûwʻâh","pron":"tesh-oo-aw'","from":"or תְּשֻׁעָה; from H7768 (שָׁוַע) in the sense of H3467 (יָשַׁע);","def":"rescue (literal or figurative, persons, national or spiritual)","kjv":"deliverance, help, safety, salvation, victory.","count":34},"H8669":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּקָה","xlit":"tᵉshûwqâh","pron":"tesh-oo-kaw'","from":"from H7783 (שׁוּק) in the original sense of stretching out after;","def":"a longing","kjv":"desire.","count":3},"H8670":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּרָה","xlit":"tᵉshûwrâh","pron":"tesh-oo-raw'","from":"from H7788 (שׁוּר) in the sense of arrival;","def":"a gift","kjv":"present.","count":1},"H8671":{"lemma":"תְּשִׁיעִי","xlit":"tᵉshîyʻîy","pron":"tesh-ee-ee'","from":"ordinal from H8672 (תֵּשַׁע);","def":"ninth","kjv":"ninth.","count":18},"H8672":{"lemma":"תֵּשַׁע","xlit":"têshaʻ","pron":"tay'-shah","from":"or (masculine) תִּשְׁעָה; perhaps from H8159 (שָׁעָה) through the idea of a turn to the next